    "When on, export uses %lld × %lld and %@. Turn off to choose a different output size or frame rate in Export." : {
      "comment" : "A description of a toggle that lets the user choose whether the output video from the app will have the same size and frame rate as the canvas in which it was created.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
